==Description==

Increases [[Idle Mode|idle bonus]] with time spent idle and summon efficiency with amount of autoclicks performed. Has a unique Idle bar bonus, which increases Idle bonus based on amount of Autoclicks currently performed (formula is in the Hero Ability section below).

Unique [[Sources|Source]]: Witching Cauldron, replaces Alchemy Desk.

In addition, Shaman has access to Forbidden Tomes (instead of Grimoires) and Trees of Life (instead of Enchanted Trees), like the {{ClassTooltip|Necromancer}} and {{ClassTooltip|Druid}}.

Upon reaching [[Paragon]] 42, Shaman may take on either [[Ascension Forms]]: {{ClassTooltip|Demiurge}} or {{ClassTooltip|Defiance}}.

