==Hero Ability==

Multiplies Idle bonus by:
<br><math>\frac{\left(T_{G}+1\right)^2}{1000} \times C^{0.30} \times L^{1.6} + L + 1</math>


Multiplies Summoning spell efficiency by:
<br><math>\left(1 + \frac{A\times G^{0.25}}{10000} \right)^{0.85} \times \frac{C^{0.155} \times L^{0.31} }{400} + 1</math>

where:
* <math>L = \text{Character Level}</math>
* <math>C = \text{Character Ability Power}</math>
* <math>G = \text{Character Ability Power Growth Rate}</math>
* <math>T = \text{Time Spent as Shaman this Exile, in Hours}</math>
* <math>A = \text{Autoclicks this Exile}</math>

and <math>T_{G}</math> is the growth- and softcap modified time, given by:
* <math>T_{G} = \begin{cases}
 T \times G,  &\text{ if } 1 + T\times G < 720  \quad \text{and} \\
719 + {\left(T \times G - 719\right)}^{0.9} , &\text{ if } 1 + T\times G\geq 720.
\end{cases}
</math>

After 7e7 autoclicks:

* <math>A = \left(\text{Autoclicks this Exile} - 7\times 10^7\right)^{0.75}+7\times 10^7</math>

===Idle Bar Bonus===
Multiplies Idle Bonus by:
<br><math>10 \times A^{0.5} + 1</math>

where:
*<math>A = \text{Autoclicks currently performed}</math>

